// HZM coop - REPORT A BUG, compose page (bugreport_parity_2026-09-29, bug-3278). The player types what happened
// and how to repeat it, picks what to attach, and REVIEW builds the exact upload (engine coop_reportprepare,
// client/cl_bugreport.cpp) and opens coop_report_review. Nothing is sent from this page. ESC discards the text
// (the menu restores its cvars on ESC).
// GENERATED by docs/proposals/bugreport_parity_2026-09-29/tools/gen_report_urc.py - DO NOT HAND-EDIT.
