linkstring 1 "REPORT SENT - THANK YOU!"
linkstring 2 "NOT SENT - REPORTING IS NOT SET UP ON THIS INSTALL"
linkstring 3 "NOT SENT - COULD NOT SAVE THE REPORT"
linkstring 4 "SENDING..."
linkstring 5 "NOT SENT - SEND FAILED (YOUR COPY: OPEN FOLDER)"
linkstring 6 "NOT SENT - TOO BIG: UNTICK THE SCREENSHOT"
linkstring 7 "NOT SENT - DISCORD IS BUSY, TRY AGAIN IN A MINUTE"
linkstring 8 "DRY RUN - SAVED LOCALLY, NOTHING WAS SENT"
linkstring 9 "PLEASE WAIT A MINUTE BEFORE SENDING ANOTHER"
linkstring 10 "SOMETHING CHANGED - CHECK THIS PAGE, THEN SEND"
linkstring 11 "REPORT LIMIT REACHED - USE THE DESKTOP REPORTER"
linkstring 12 "DRY RUN MODE - NOTHING WILL BE POSTED"
